      "text": "\ud83d\udcd6 REST API Service (Puerto 8001)\n\u2022 FastAPI + Uvicorn\n\u2022 Documentaci\u00f3n Swagger UI (/docs)\n\u2022 Tokens JWT Bearer (Stateless)\n\u2022 Versionado de URLs (/v1 vs /v2)",
