      "text": "\ud83c\udf47 GraphQL Service (Puerto 8002)\n\u2022 Strawberry GraphQL + FastAPI\n\u2022 GraphiQL Playground (/graphql)\n\u2022 Men\u00fa a la carta (Cero Over-fetching)\n\u2022 Consultas anidadas (Cero Under-fetching)",
      "originalText": "\ud83c\udf47 GraphQL Service (Puerto 8002)\n\u2022 Strawberry GraphQL + FastAPI\n\u2022 GraphiQL Playground (/graphql)\n\u2022 Men\u00fa a la carta (Cero Over-fetching)\n\u2022 Consultas anidadas (Cero Under-fetching)",
