      "text": "\ud83d\udce1 Real-Time Service (Puerto 8003)\n\u2022 WebSockets (/ws/chat) Full-Duplex\n\u2022 Server-Sent Events (/sse/ai-tutor)\n\u2022 Webhooks receptor (/webhooks)\n\u2022 Dashboard Web en vivo",
